(text "R1: Standard IBM-PC 34-pin FDD rear interface; cable twist handled by firmware selection.\n5V inputs use 5.5V-tolerant LVC245 at 3.3V. Outputs are TN0702 open drain; ASSERT=1 pulls cable LOW.\nJ3 is the isolated seven-wire contact output. J5 series seat-NO/eject-NC loop MUST open before disk motion.\nJ6: 8-ohm speaker, PWM audio on GP27. J4 pin6 reserved; dock lighting via UART.\nPico is a factory-assembled SMD module plugged into TH sockets. Carrier assembly is through-hole.\nLegacy floppy encoding/track streaming and native dock protocol require new firmware; no compatibility claim." (at 30 410 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid b421bea3-a280-4123-8f6c-1e2a9b5a7bcf))(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))